#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:1
msgid "ADR-0026: Community catalogue"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:3
msgid "**Status**: accepted"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:4
msgid "**Date**: 2026-10-20"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:5
msgid "**Plan step**: P15.16"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:7
msgid "Context"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:9
msgid ""
"Declarative components (ADR-0025) and presets are worth sharing. The "
"review of 20/10/2026 (docs/specs/pistes_evolution.md §2) settled that the"
" catalogue lives in the LUMOS repository, in a `community/` folder for "
"the contributions of the community, with a CI filtered by path, an index "
"with one entry per contribution (author, version, license, minimum "
"format), and a \"Catalogue\" tab of the palette that imports a "
"declarative component in one click. Components with code are Python "
"packages installed locally (`lumos-component-…`), never run on the public"
" instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:16
msgid "Decision"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:18
msgid ""
"**Layout.** `community/components/<author>/<Name>.lumos` (documents of "
"kind `component`, identifier `<author>.<Name>`), "
"`community/presets/<author>/<name>.lumos` (contexts whose `meta` gives "
"`name`, `description`, `authors` and `license`; the components they use "
"are embedded), `community/README.md` (how to contribute) and "
"`community/index.json`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:22
msgid ""
"**Index.** `lumos.catalogue.build_index(root)` makes the index from the "
"files: per entry `kind` (`component` or `preset`), `id` (`author.Name` or"
" `author/name`), `title`, `description`, `authors`, `version` "
"(components), `license`, `lumos_format` (the format of the file, the "
"minimum to read it) and `path`. The committed index must equal the built "
"one; `tools/build_catalogue.py` writes it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:26
msgid ""
"**Checks.** `lumos.catalogue.check_catalogue(root)` lists what refuses a "
"contribution: a component failing `check_component` (its checks carry "
"independent reference values), a file not at the place of its identifier,"
" a preset without license, authors or description, or not loading, a "
"format newer than the library. The workflow `community.yml` runs it, "
"`lumos component check` on every component and the index check, on "
"changes to `community/` only; the main CI ignores changes under "
"`community/`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:31
msgid ""
"**Shipping.** The wheel includes `community/` as `lumos/community` (like "
"the presets); the service finds it there, else in the repository, or in "
"`ServiceConfig.catalogue_dir`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:33
msgid ""
"**Service.** `list_catalogue(query)`, `use_catalogue_component(session, "
"id)` (registers the component in the session, as the editor does) and "
"`open_catalogue_preset(session, id)` (a new context). Identifiers are "
"looked up in the index only, so nothing outside it can be read; the "
"routes `/api/catalogue...` and the MCP tools `list_catalogue` and "
"`use_catalogue` are thin adapters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:38
msgid "Alternatives considered"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:40
msgid ""
"A separate repository for the catalogue: two CIs and two reviews, and "
"contributions lagging behind the format; refused on 20/10."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:42
msgid ""
"Fetching the index from GitHub at run time: needs the network, and an "
"instance would show contributions that its version cannot read."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:44
msgid ""
"Executable contributions in `community/`: code never runs on the public "
"instance (ADR-0025 §5); code components are packages installed by whoever"
" runs the instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:47
msgid "Consequences"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:49
msgid ""
"A contribution is a pull request adding one file (and the rebuilt index);"
" reviewers see its checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:50
msgid ""
"The catalogue of an instance is the one of its version; a new "
"contribution reaches the public instance when it is redeployed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0026-community-catalogue.md:52
msgid ""
"Shared resources of the public instance (P15.5) will join `community/` "
"with their own kind of entry."
msgstr ""

